              "id": "multiplayer",
              "title": "Play Natiely together",
              "description": "You and a teammate join the same Natiely room over WebSocket. The API gateway checks identity and routes inputs to the room authority. The server validates movement and broadcasts snapshots to both players. Redis caches presence and room lookup; durable checkpoints live in the database. Clients send intent, not trusted positions or rewards.",
