            {
              "id": "world-bundles",
              "title": "Download an extra world",
              "description": "Natiely checks world access through Content API and reads a versioned manifest. A build worker prepares platform-specific asset bundles; a validation worker checks their hashes before publishing immutable files to object storage. The CDN serves those files through a private origin. Natiely downloads over HTTPS, validates the bundle and caches it locally. Interrupted downloads can resume or retry; an incomplete world is never marked ready. Bundles contain game assets, not executable updates.",
