            {
              "id": "match-recovery",
              "title": "Finish a match, reconnect",
              "description": "The room authority records the terminal checkpoint and a durable reward intent. An outbox dispatcher feeds the result queue, and the settlement worker grants Gold and inventory once per match. Rejoining restores the last committed room state and reads the durable wallet. The public ranking API serves a separate request: it reads a short-lived Redis snapshot and loads the group ranking from MongoDB on a cache miss.",
